notes.notes:
- A config dialog will now appear when launching the game, where you can select your resolution and change other settings. This should fix black screen issues that some users could have when starting the game;
- The UI for Main Menu and Pause Menu have been reworked. Now, the UI is compatible with mouse input. Due to limitations, keyboard and controller input for UI buttons are no longer supported.
- Adjusted the speed of some objects and animations across the game;
- Added a new energy recovery stone near the garden entrance, to prevent players from unnecessary interruptions when carrying artifacts in this area;
- Fixed some issues that could prevent progression when returning to the main menu after playing the game, and continuing the game without closing the application.

- A few changes have been made to the lighthouse puzzle, in order to offer better feedback to the player;

- Minor corrections related to some colliders of the game;

- Corrected wrong characters and words in some texts;

- Minor interface update.

